 in the final plane\"\n    ],\n    \"central_topic\": \"Predicting unmeasured MTEB text-embedding benchmark scores for held-out models from a small queried benchmark budget using low-rank score-matrix prediction and historically calibrated local residual corrections.\",\n    \"comparators\": [\n      \"Cold-start collaborative filtering and regularized matrix completion\",\n      \"Local conditional-median regression under absolute-error loss and neighborhood prediction\",\n      \"V-optimal experimental design and active rating elicitation under a query budget; related design literature, not a completed design ablation\",\n      \"Shrinkage covariance estimation with incomplete observations; connected to the evaluated covariance alternative\",\n      \"tinyBenchmarks: example-level evaluation compression, distinct from selecting whole benchmark columns\",\n      \"Observational Scaling Laws and Sloth: latent-capability and skill-based multi-benchmark performance prediction; literature comparators, not implemented experimental baselines\"\n    ],\n    \"core_methods\": [\n      \"Masked, column-centered, ridge-regularized low-rank matrix factorization fitted by alternating least squares, with conditional ridge inference for new models\",\n      \"Cross-fitted historical donor residuals with overlap-aware Gaussian-kernel weights, target-wise weighted medians, effective-count shrinkage, and history-only blend selection including a zero-correction fallback\",\n      \"Greedy integrated predictive-variance reduction for selecting benchmark columns from latent-factor covariance; score values condition prediction, not the query ordering\",\n      \"Evaluated alternative: overlap-shrunk pairwise covariance, positive-semidefinite repair, and self-excluding conditional transfer selection\"\n    ],\n    \"forbidden_query_patterns\": [\n      \"Broad task-restatement searches such as predict LLM benchmark scores from few benchmarks or benchmark selection LLM performance predic