em\nParvin2019ASA\tA scalable and robust trust-based nonnegative matrix factorization recommender using the alternating direction method\nDakhel2018ASR\tA social recommender system using item asymmetric correlation\nPaleti2020ApproachingTC\tApproaching the cold-start problem using community detection based alternating least square factorization in recommendation systems\nZhang2012InducibleRF\tInducible regularization for low-rank matrix factorizations for collaborative filtering\nDeng2019PSLEP\tPSL: Exploiting Parallelism, Sparsity and Locality to Accelerate Matrix Factorization on x86 Platforms\nNatarajan2022CDSemMFCS\tCD-SemMF: Cross-Domain Semantic Relatedness Based Matrix Factorization Model Enabled with Linked Open Data for User Cold Start Issue\nJune2013ColdSR\tCold Start Recommendations : A Non-negative Matrix Factorization Approach\nEfrizoni2025OptimizationOC\tOptimization of Content Recommendation System Based on User Preferences Using Neural Collaborative Filtering\ntotal 104\ndrwx------ 8 agent agent  4096 Nov 17 13:22 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 root  root    160 Nov 17 13:29 ..\n-rw------- 1 agent agent    41 Nov 17 12:38 .agentic_resume_policy.json\n-rw------- 1 agent agent   153 Nov 17 13:18 .investigation_completion.json\n-rw------- 2 agent agent   138 Nov 17 12:37 .task.agentic_task_ready.c6c8bf01a942c68fde625ec81735f34acd36f249b0a0a007c139d087b68a2723\ndrwx------ 3 agent agent  4096 Nov 17 13:22 final_evaluation\ndrwx------ 9 agent agent  4096 Nov 17 13:22 investigation\ndrwx------ 2 agent agent  4096 Nov 17 13:27 metrics\ndrwx------ 5 agent agent  4096 Nov 17 13:29 paper\n-rw------- 1 agent agent 61411 Nov 17 13:32 pipeline_events.jsonl\ndrwxrwxr-x 5 agent agent  4096 Nov 17 12:38 task\ndrwx------ 5 agent agent  4096 Nov 17 12:37 task_drafting\n./reference_query_plan_validation_feedback.json\n./reference_query_plan_validation_feedback.md\n./paper_diagnostics/reference_query_plan/round_0000/attempt_001/reference_query_plan_validation_feedback.md\n./paper_diagnostics/reference_query_plan/round_0000/attempt_001/reference_query_plan_validation_feedback.json\nnumpy==1.26.4\nmatplotlib==3.9.2\n            raise ValueError('incomplete upload')\n        rows, columns = metadata['shape']\n        count = rows * columns\n        _state['values'] = np.frombuffer(_state['upload'], dtype='<f8', count=count).reshape(rows, columns).copy()\n        _state['mask'] = np.frombuffer(_state['upload'], dtype='u1', offset=8*count).reshape(rows, columns).copy()\n        if (not np.isfinite(_state['values']).all() or not np.isin(_state['mask'], [0, 1]).all()\n                or np.any((_state['values'] < 0) | (_state['values'] > 1))):\n            raise ValueError('invalid history')\n        del _state['upload']\n        return {'ok': True}\n    if operation == 'fit':\n        values, mask = _state['values'], _state['mask'].astype(bool)\n        rank = min(int(request['rank']), *values.shape)\n        ridge = float(request['ridge'])\n        sweeps = int(request['sweeps'])\n        if not 1 <= rank <= 16 or not 1 <= sweeps <= 50 or not math.isfinite(ridge) or ridge <= 0:\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
